      "description": "ItemType categorizes the primary type of service being offered.\nThis helps organize services in the system and determines applicable business rules.\n\n - SERVICE_ITEM_TYPE_UNSPECIFIED: Unknown or unspecified service type\nShould not be used when creating new services\n - GROOMING: Pet grooming services\nIncludes bathing, haircuts, nail trimming, etc.\n - BOARDING: Pet boarding services\nOvernight or extended stay care\n - DAYCARE: Daytime pet care services\nSupervised play and care during business hours\n - EVALUATION: Pet evaluation services\nBehavior assessment and service compatibility check\n - TRAINING: Pet training services\nIndividual or group training sessions"
